{
  "format": "lengsuo-unlock-client-vectors",
  "version": 1,
  "spec": "服务端契约 docs/server-contract/04-fingerprint.md §7.6（POST /client/secrets/unlock）",
  "notes": [
    "跨端测试向量：Swift / Kotlin 侧读**同一份**文件逐条对拍，不靠真机。",
    "请求体四项且仅四项：credential_id / secret_id / store_id / device_id。",
    "tenant_id / user_id / aad 一律按未知字段拒（contract 10002）。",
    "credential_id 入参大小写皆可，规范形态是小写（expect_canonical_credential_id）。",
    "成功响应恒为 code=0 / msg=ok / data={\"secret\":\"<小写 hex>\"}，只解一条、只回一条。",
    "响应码非 0 时即使 data 里有 secret 也必须拒；未知码一律 fail-closed。",
    "请求用例省略的字段取固定合法默认值：credential_id=00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff、secret_id=secret-1、store_id=store-1、device_id=dev0101。",
    "expect_valid=true ⇒ expect_code=0 且 expect_stable_name 为空。"
  ],
  "endpoint": {
    "path": "/client/secrets/unlock",
    "method": "POST"
  },
  "success": {
    "code": 0,
    "msg": "ok",
    "data": {
      "secret": "<lowercase hex>"
    }
  },
  "error_codes": {
    "CredentialReferenceInvalid": 60006,
    "UnlockAuditBlocked": 60007,
    "InvalidRequest": 10002,
    "PermissionDenied": 50116,
    "EndpointAbsent": 10404,
    "InvalidDeviceId": 50100
  },
  "request_fields": [
    "credential_id",
    "secret_id",
    "store_id",
    "device_id"
  ],
  "forbidden_fields": [
    "tenant_id",
    "user_id",
    "aad"
  ],
  "request_cases": [
